{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Tokyo Underground Killer",
    "steam_appid": 2063090,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2063090/extras/2d88eff7bdccab2c13e0345dd3bcc3a3.poster.avif?t=1751276152\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2063090/extras/2d88eff7bdccab2c13e0345dd3bcc3a3.webm?t=1751276152\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2063090/extras/2d88eff7bdccab2c13e0345dd3bcc3a3.mp4?t=1751276152\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>Neon-infused katana action in a fever dream Tokyo!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dive into Tokyo's criminal underground as the feared &quot;Shinjuku Vampire&quot; Kobayashi and take out crazy lunatics for just the right price.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2063090/extras/0c72bcb4a74a45d0a8a1467398239648.poster.avif?t=1751276152\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2063090/extras/0c72bcb4a74a45d0a8a1467398239648.webm?t=1751276152\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2063090/extras/0c72bcb4a74a45d0a8a1467398239648.mp4?t=1751276152\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><strong>\u30fbUnrelenting katana combat:</strong> Slash, stab and parry your way through hordes of monsters inspired by Japanese demons</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u30fbBlood is the key to survival:</strong> Use 10 different blood skills to overcome challenging enemies, then suck in their blood to replenish your health and skills</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u30fbFever dream Tokyo:</strong> Explore neon-drenched renditions of real places like Shinjuku, Akihabara or Shibuya</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u30fbEnjoy Tokyo's nighlife:</strong> Between missions you can relax in your own apartment in Shinjuku, buy decorations and play minigames in the city hub</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u30fbBecome Unstoppable:</strong> Upgrade your ability tree to become stronger and unlock new abilities</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u30fbHand drawn comic:</strong> A bizarre story with crazy characters brought to live in dynamic comic scenes drawn by Hans \u201cHeavy Metal Hanzo\u201d Steinbach</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u30fbThanks, Andrew:</strong> Over 2 hour of original electronic music composed by the legendary Andrew Hulshult </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2063090/extras/0cc4d38576adf6a5969746c671cf6052.poster.avif?t=1751276152\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2063090/extras/0cc4d38576adf6a5969746c671cf6052.webm?t=1751276152\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2063090/extras/0cc4d38576adf6a5969746c671cf6052.mp4?t=1751276152\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2063090/extras/2d88eff7bdccab2c13e0345dd3bcc3a3.poster.avif?t=1751276152\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2063090/extras/2d88eff7bdccab2c13e0345dd3bcc3a3.webm?t=1751276152\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2063090/extras/2d88eff7bdccab2c13e0345dd3bcc3a3.mp4?t=1751276152\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>Neon-infused katana action in a fever dream Tokyo!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dive into Tokyo's criminal underground as the feared &quot;Shinjuku Vampire&quot; Kobayashi and take out crazy lunatics for just the right price.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2063090/extras/0c72bcb4a74a45d0a8a1467398239648.poster.avif?t=1751276152\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2063090/extras/0c72bcb4a74a45d0a8a1467398239648.webm?t=1751276152\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2063090/extras/0c72bcb4a74a45d0a8a1467398239648.mp4?t=1751276152\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><strong>\u30fbUnrelenting katana combat:</strong> Slash, stab and parry your way through hordes of monsters inspired by Japanese demons</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u30fbBlood is the key to survival:</strong> Use 10 different blood skills to overcome challenging enemies, then suck in their blood to replenish your health and skills</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u30fbFever dream Tokyo:</strong> Explore neon-drenched renditions of real places like Shinjuku, Akihabara or Shibuya</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u30fbEnjoy Tokyo's nighlife:</strong> Between missions you can relax in your own apartment in Shinjuku, buy decorations and play minigames in the city hub</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u30fbBecome Unstoppable:</strong> Upgrade your ability tree to become stronger and unlock new abilities</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u30fbHand drawn comic:</strong> A bizarre story with crazy characters brought to live in dynamic comic scenes drawn by Hans \u201cHeavy Metal Hanzo\u201d Steinbach</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u30fbThanks, Andrew:</strong> Over 2 hour of original electronic music composed by the legendary Andrew Hulshult </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2063090/extras/0cc4d38576adf6a5969746c671cf6052.poster.avif?t=1751276152\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2063090/extras/0cc4d38576adf6a5969746c671cf6052.webm?t=1751276152\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2063090/extras/0cc4d38576adf6a5969746c671cf6052.mp4?t=1751276152\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>",
    "short_description": "Dive into the neon-drenched deep underground of Tokyo as Kobayashi, a deadly assassin who harnesses the power of blood energy. Use your sword, mystical abilities and powerful weapons to assassinate highly dangerous maniacs and stop the invasion of the brutal Flatliners terrorizing Tokyo.",
